for pyi."] [355 1 "// configPublic are PYCONFIG_SPEC's public members (PyConfig_Set may set them; the rest of configSpecs is read-only)."] [362 1 "// configFlagOf are the sys.flags fields of the public members PyConfig_Set writes through _PySys_SetFlagObj (the"] [363 1 "// member negated for use_environment and write_bytecode)."] [372 1 "// configSet is CPython's PyConfig_Set (Python/initconfig.c): the value checked by the member's type, then a sys"] [373 1 "// attribute set, or sys.flags replaced by a new flags object with the field set (write_bytecode also"] [374 1 "// sys.dont_write_bytecode), or int_max_str_digits through sys.set_int_max_str_digits."] [376 55 "// PySys_Audit(\"cpython.PyConfig_Set\", \"sO\", name, value)"] [463 3 "// a new sys.flags object: pyi's flags type is not instantiable from here (no core hook yet)"] [496 1 "// setSysFlag is _PySys_SetFlagObj: sys.flags replaced by a new flags object with field name set to v (a structseq"] [497 1 "// rebuilt from its __reduce__: the sequence's fields, then the dict of the fields by name only)."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[149 23] [150 23] [168 23] [194 23] [203 45] [257 36] [258 25] [268 35] [269 43] [275 33] [330 23] [331 25] [376 40] [381 89] [462 32] [466 32] [474 48] [488 50] [521 63] [535 24] [540 44]] :go/trails [[111 48]]} (go/file "capi_config.go" :imports [

